{"title":"1963 AHSME Problems/Problem 30","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1963_AHSME_Problems/Problem_30&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/c/3/4c3a2e066ff01540c3256688dd190e7309f5ad22.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$F=\\log\\dfrac{1+x}{1-x}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"109\" height=\"37\" />. Find a new function <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/e/2/6e28ce12d49d39f160d5a0ef54077fc98e4b9d2b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$G$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"16\" height=\"14\" /> by replacing each <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" /> in <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/0/5/a055f405829e64a3b70253ab67cb45ed6ed5bb29.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$F$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"16\" height=\"14\" /> by <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/8/f/98f38c9001fc63253fae5a9395ad50088c1375e4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\dfrac{3x+x^3}{1+3x^2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -14px\" width=\"62\" height=\"40\" />, and simplify. \nThe simplified expression <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/e/2/6e28ce12d49d39f160d5a0ef54077fc98e4b9d2b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$G$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"16\" height=\"14\" /> is equal to:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/9/0/f90e9502f8e8d5cf1274595482441fb968294945.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A)}\\ -F \\qquad \\textbf{(B)}\\ F\\qquad \\textbf{(C)}\\ 3F \\qquad \\textbf{(D)}\\ F^3 \\qquad \\textbf{(E)}\\ F^3-F$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"457\" height=\"19\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1963_AHSME_Problems/Problem_30&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Replace the <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" /> in <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/0/5/a055f405829e64a3b70253ab67cb45ed6ed5bb29.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$F$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"16\" height=\"14\" /> with <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/0/e/a0e1598958b4ddfa60bff32bff29f5b8c5926689.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{3x+x^3}{1+3x^2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -15px\" width=\"65\" height=\"42\" />.\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/6/6/166f433ba56db1268d2c0f2fdd688381433721f8.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\log\\dfrac{1 + \\frac{3x+x^3}{1+3x^2} }{1 - \\frac{3x+x^3}{1+3x^2} }\\]\" width=\"102\" height=\"54\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/3/9/e39dd4158fdcf68ea52ad84120703383bb2b6406.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\log\\dfrac{\\frac{1+3x^2}{1+3x^2} + \\frac{3x+x^3}{1+3x^2} }{\\frac{1+3x^2}{1+3x^2} - \\frac{3x+x^3}{1+3x^2} }\\]\" width=\"134\" height=\"54\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/e/3/4e397413bf84888598184ad7c584b33d26ed553f.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\log (\\frac{1+3x+3x^2+x^3}{1+3x^2} \\div \\frac{1-3x+3x^2-x^3}{1+3x^2})\\]\" width=\"346\" height=\"40\" />\nRecall that from the <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Binomial_Theorem\" title=\"Binomial Theorem\">Binomial Theorem</a>, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/9/5/895a3f8a775347ed81f817d240b05cdd4d6f4c6d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(1+x)^3 = 1+3x+3x^2+x^3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"226\" height=\"19\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/0/5/40596558ede78b1ecb04d5cf392bc1dc0431eea4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(1-x)^3 = 1-3x+3x^2-x^3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"226\" height=\"19\" />.\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/9/e/79e1ecb454c582736b8f2535b7ab192cd3a1b2e9.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\log (\\frac{(1+x)^3}{1+3x^2} \\div \\frac{(1-x)^3}{1+3x^2})\\]\" width=\"192\" height=\"40\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/c/8/cc8f82d8a4e08fff33ace0820c8b2350c6be2053.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\log\\dfrac{(1+x)^3}{(1-x)^3}\\]\" width=\"91\" height=\"43\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/a/f/7aff770778cae09b1e5e2e55312a96dbadf2ac83.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[3 \\log\\dfrac{1+x}{1-x}\\]\" width=\"82\" height=\"37\" />\nThus, the expression is equivalent to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/b/d/bbd8641dcba187dea863ba189c8926130f1ce45b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3F$\" width=\"23\" height=\"12\" />, which is answer choice <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/f/f/fffc7368e8e7b77c88b0b4bf732c88c60e27b439.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\textbf{(C)}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"42\" height=\"30\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1963_AHSME_Problems/Problem_30&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1963_AHSME\" title=\"1963 AHSME\">1963 AHSC</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1963_AHSME_Problems\" title=\"1963 AHSME Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1963_AHSME_Answer_Key\" title=\"1963 AHSME Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=44&amp;year=1963\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1963_AHSME_Problems/Problem_29\" title=\"1963 AHSME Problems/Problem 29\">Problem 29</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1963_AHSME_Problems/Problem_31\" title=\"1963 AHSME Problems/Problem 31\">Problem 31</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1963_AHSME_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"1963 AHSME Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1963_AHSME_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"1963 AHSME Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1963_AHSME_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"1963 AHSME Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1963_AHSME_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"1963 AHSME Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1963_AHSME_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"1963 AHSME Problems/Problem 5\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1963_AHSME_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"1963 AHSME Problems/Problem 6\">6</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1963_AHSME_Problems/Problem_7\" title=\"1963 AHSME Problems/Problem 7\">7</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1963_AHSME_Problems/Problem_8\" title=\"1963 AHSME Problems/Problem 8\">8</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1963_AHSME_Problems/Problem_9\" title=\"1963 AHSME Problems/Problem 9\">9</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1963_AHSME_Problems/Problem_10\" title=\"1963 AHSME Problems/Problem 10\">10</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/